<title>USA: Ridgeview Inc Q4 shr profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Ridgeview Inc Q4 shr profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>NEWTON, N.C. 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.28     loss	 $0.21</p>
<p> Net profit		   711     loss	   343</p>
<p> Sales		     20,900		   15,800</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   1,832		    1,594</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.96   profit	 $0.15</p>
<p> Net profit		 1,800   profit	   241</p>
<p> Sales		     76,800		   54,800</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   1,832		    1,594</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Q4 1995 includes charges of $99,360, or $0.06 per share, for write-off of obsolete, unfinshed women's hosiery products, and $320,000, or $0.20 per share, for a supplemental retirement obligation for the company's former chairman.</p>
